      </entryLinks>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink name="Freakish Spectacle" id="83ffb3fc-56ea-a331-661e-7705daaa23c2" hidden="false" targetId="9addafac-476c-1d71-2a6a-1f863bd67388" type="rule"/>
      </infoLinks>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Latest Experiments" id="6672da69-ee45-fe55-ed32-f70bad7a723a" hidden="false">
          <description>After determining Warlord Traits, but before deploying the first unit in your army, roll a D6 and look up the result on the table to the right. All units of Grotesques in this Formation receive the characteristics bonus or special rule listed on the table for the duration of the battle.
D6	Results
1	Mauler Steroids: +1 Strength
2	Subcutaneous Chitin: +1 Toughness
3	Hyperstimm Glands: Fleet
4	Flensing Claw: Shred
5	Elixir of Distilled Fury: Rage
6	Restructured Nervous System: Feel No Pain (4+)</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <selectionEntryGroups>
        <selectionEntryGroup name="Leader" id="2861a7d5-dade-58fb-999d-99febeade8bc" collective="false" defaultSelectionEntryId="dbe62aa5-0f6f-fd02-c429-ec7384b4205a" hidden="false" import="true">
